            "review_title": "Review at Lang Chai Sea Food",
            "review_text": "Billy Jang\n47 contributions\n0\nI am completely satisfied with Da Nang seafood restaurant ~\nJun 2024 • Family\nI found this place while looking for a seafood restaurant in Da Nang. \nI went to a famous place nearby because I had to wait too long. \nIt was so cool in the air conditioned room and the food was delicious. \nI am so satisfied ~ My whole family was satisfied haha\nI really liked that the staff was so kind and explained things well. \nIf anyone is looking for a seafood restaurant in Da Nang,\nI definitely recommend it!!\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten June 13, 2024",
